# Markdown images

When embedding screenshots or demo images in Markdown (README, docs, changelogs):

- Prefer `width="30%"` on `<img>` tags
- Do **not** use fixed pixel widths like `width="220"`
- At most **3 images per row** — put each row in its own `<p>...</p>`
- Prefer **absolute** `raw.githubusercontent.com` URLs (so GitHub and pub.dev both render after push to `main`)

Example:

```html
<p>
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shang1219178163/flutter_packages/main/packages/<pkg>/screenshot/a.png" width="30%" alt="A">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shang1219178163/flutter_packages/main/packages/<pkg>/screenshot/b.png" width="30%" alt="B">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shang1219178163/flutter_packages/main/packages/<pkg>/screenshot/c.png" width="30%" alt="C">
</p>
<p>
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shang1219178163/flutter_packages/main/packages/<pkg>/screenshot/d.png" width="30%" alt="D">
</p>
```
